WEBVTT

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:47.560
<i>Asura Cryin'</i>

00:02:01.070 --> 00:02:04.500
"Thoughts with Nowhere to Go"

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:10.670
Good job, guys.

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:11.840
"Third Student Council Lake Dobi Lodge"

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:13.460
Thanks for all your hard work.

00:02:15.090 --> 00:02:17.960
Well done on your first day of camp.

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:19.800
Cheers!

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:21.140
Cheers!

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:23.680
No need for formalities.

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:25.020
Have as much as you'd like!

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:29.220
The science club sure is great!

00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:31.000
Shall we go camping every month?

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:36.180
What is the meaning of this?

00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:41.360
I didn't hire you to host a party.

00:02:41.690 --> 00:02:43.750
Eating properly is important.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:46.610
A barbecue is hardly necessary.

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:49.800
Life is something to enjoy, Saeki.

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:51.900
We aren't here to have fun.

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:53.640
Don't worry.

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:55.740
I'll catch that Dobussie.

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:57.550
Dobussie?

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:59.660
If the Loch Ness Monster is Nessie...

00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:02.590
...the monster of Lake Dobi is Dobussie.

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:04.580
How stupid.

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:09.440
As you know, this place is home to Rakurowa High School's training facility.

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:15.810
As part of freshman orientation, we have a schedule full of extra curricular activities planned.

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:21.180
It is our responsibility to make sure the area is secure as possible.

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:24.180
Don't worry. It's a piece of cake.

00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:27.370
I'm telling you because I'm worried.

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:30.020
Then why don't you fire us and do it yourself?

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:34.330
Oh, that's right. It would be a little difficult with Hisui out for repairs.

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:37.700
Capture or exterminate.

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:39.440
Make no mistakes.

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:44.690
What are you trying to do?

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:47.660
You better not do anything to Tomo again.

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:52.510
I'll go check on the meat.

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:54.620
I'll get the curry.

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:58.420
Why did you bring Kanade Takatsuki?

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:01.680
You know she's a member of the Science Club.

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:06.640
Tomoharu.

00:04:07.150 --> 00:04:08.350
They're all done.

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:10.230
Want some?

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:11.170
No.

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:14.610
I wanted to talk to you about protecting Aine.

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:18.450
I know it was a while ago, but thanks.

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:20.410
Hey.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:22.950
Who is she?

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:24.360
My cousin.

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:26.680
Why is she...?

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:27.550
How was she?

00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:30.010
You met Aine, didn't you?

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:31.500
Oh, right.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:33.960
You can't see her.

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:36.210
Was she happy?

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.310
With Reishiro...

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:42.650
I see.

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:45.950
I'll do it.

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:47.760
Okay.

00:04:57.800 --> 00:04:59.320
She was certainly on fire.

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:00.950
W-what?

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.440
Nothing.

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:04.320
Is the curry done yet?

00:05:08.020 --> 00:05:09.790
What's wrong, Kanade?

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.670
Did Tomoharu do something to you?

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:14.280
She was on fire.

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:15.590
Oh, really?

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:17.180
Keep your mouth shut.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:22.870
It would be a shame if you didn't have a little fun, Kanade.

00:05:23.560 --> 00:05:24.750
It's fun...

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:27.040
...with Tomoharu.

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:38.010
Let me be blunt.

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:43.700
Have you had an intimate encounter with Kanade Takatsuki?

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:44.720
What?

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:47.070
I'm asking if you've had intercourse.

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:50.000
Intercourse?

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:53.160
Did you do her?

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:55.580
N-no! I haven't.

00:05:56.090 --> 00:05:58.480
Under no circumstances should you become intimate with her.

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:05.000
If you become her contractor, we will have to eliminate one of you immediately.

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:09.350
You really haven't slept with her, right?

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:11.350
I told you, no!

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:14.020
I'm going back to the lodge.

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:15.620
I'll have Reiko keep an eye on you.

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:17.180
Don't try anything.

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:18.550
You have nothing to worry about.

00:06:20.390 --> 00:06:23.330
"Second Student Council Dobi Lake Lodge"

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:35.550
Just give up, Mahiwa.

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:38.010
It's the fate of one who's made a deal with a demon.

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:44.060
Don't break them.

00:06:44.060 --> 00:06:45.440
I know, I know.

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:49.530
I know your brother is to thank for all of this.

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:51.670
What are you talking about?

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:53.190
Don't worry.

00:06:53.190 --> 00:06:55.190
If I can prove the existence of the Dobussie...

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:58.190
...I'm sure your brother will acknowledge our relationship.

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:06.300
Good thing they're waterproof.

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:11.770
It sure is great to have a break.

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:13.590
We're here to eliminate monsters.

00:07:13.770 --> 00:07:17.350
Whatever. I don't get to go anywhere being with you.

00:07:17.820 --> 00:07:21.740
You won't have any friends being a shut in.

00:07:22.390 --> 00:07:24.090
I just don't go on trips.

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:26.660
We don't go to movies or amusement parks.

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:29.380
I can't go to the amusement park by myself.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:31.120
I'd be with you.

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:33.120
Sure, but...

00:07:34.310 --> 00:07:38.330
Well, I'll always be with you, so at least you won't die lonely.

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:39.420
Don't worry.

00:07:39.780 --> 00:07:40.830
You better not.

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:44.780
With you watching over me, I won't be able to rest in peace.

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:47.860
Then we can be ghosts together!

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:52.750
They're quite a pair.

00:07:53.290 --> 00:07:55.210
Are childhood friends always like that?

00:07:56.260 --> 00:07:58.330
Those two...

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:03.910
Do you ever wish you could be alive again?

00:08:05.030 --> 00:08:06.010
Not really.

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:09.020
Being a ghost is pretty easy.

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:22.930
Put some effort into it.

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:26.700
If you don't get your smell to stick, we can't lure it out.

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:28.720
But I don't want it to come out.

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:30.170
Do it.

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:35.540
Don't do it, Higuchi.

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:38.000
If Kurosaki finds us, we're dead.

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:43.830
As a member of the Science Club, it is my duty to record the perfect creations of nature.

00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:08.320
You're lucky it wasn't a real bullet.

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:17.090
Where is Miss Takatsuki?

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:19.300
She's outside.

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:23.790
As someone who uses fire, she probably needs to cool off after a bath.

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:30.970
It sure is quiet.

00:09:30.970 --> 00:09:31.660
Are you by yourself?

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:33.540
I was just talking a walk.

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:35.100
Mind if I sit with you?

00:09:38.900 --> 00:09:41.040
I just heard a weird noise.

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:44.080
I don't know what it was.

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:46.550
Where is Misao?

00:09:46.760 --> 00:09:48.650
She's probably exhausted and sleeping.

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:51.620
She got really excited over this trip.

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:54.840
I'm having fun, too.

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:57.560
It's my first time doing something like this.

00:09:57.670 --> 00:09:58.650
Your first time?

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:04.950
I guess that would be pretty rough.

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:08.100
It's thanks to you.

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:11.250
I didn't have anyone before.

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:14.770
Someone like you.

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:18.680
W-what now?

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:20.850
Fishing with you as bait.

00:10:21.980 --> 00:10:24.010
I'm going to be eaten!

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:25.600
Don't worry.

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:27.190
I'll bring you back up.

00:10:27.380 --> 00:10:29.980
It's not going to show up no matter what we do.

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:33.030
It's probably tired of me.

00:10:43.430 --> 00:10:44.440
There you are.

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:50.820
Um... Do you like Misao?

00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:54.690
Are you sad when she's gone?

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:57.120
What are you talking about?

00:10:57.590 --> 00:10:59.660
Does it make you sad?

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:01.830
Yes.

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:05.740
Then you must not use the Asura Machina any more.

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:16.940
Natsume.

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:20.740
This isn't what it looks like!

00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:23.820
The fact you're secretly meeting her is proof enough for me.

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:24.580
Um...

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:28.890
Stay put until my brother handles this.

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:33.020
D-Dobussie?

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:34.650
What?

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:35.920
What's going on?

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:39.000
A daughter?

00:11:42.480 --> 00:11:43.350
Why?

00:11:48.280 --> 00:11:50.230
Help me!

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:51.640
Who is that?

00:12:09.070 --> 00:12:10.230
The tranquilizers aren't working.

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:11.570
Himezasa!

00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:14.000
Tomo!

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:14.900
A handler!

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:16.240
Get down.

00:12:26.030 --> 00:12:27.620
Are you trying to kill us?

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:29.320
You're fine.

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:31.130
I'm not aiming at you.

00:12:31.130 --> 00:12:32.660
That's not the issue!

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:34.000
Shuri Kurosaki.

00:12:36.930 --> 00:12:42.330
As a man-made beauty you sure do make a mess out of things.

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:43.920
Why, Miss President.

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:47.400
Aren't you a little old for pigtails?

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:50.880
Nothing will hide your villainous face.

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:53.850
Oh? Do I see wrinkles?

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:56.890
It's no surprise.

00:12:56.890 --> 00:13:00.520
An erratic smoke-filled life isn't good for your skin.

00:13:00.950 --> 00:13:03.020
More importantly, Miss President...

00:13:03.020 --> 00:13:04.940
...haven't your legs gotten fatter?

00:13:06.100 --> 00:13:09.140
It's from carrying those heavy guns all the time.

00:13:09.320 --> 00:13:11.020
And those legs were hardly thin to begin with.

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:14.030
Why you...!

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:15.330
What?

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:17.730
S-senpai, who is she?

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:21.020
President of the Second Student Council, Rikka Kurawara.

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:24.170
I've heard rumors about you, Tomoharu Natsume.

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:27.140
Why don't you quit the Science Club and join us instead?

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:29.680
But you don't like middle aged women, Tomoharu.

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:31.310
Nobody likes wrinkles.

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:32.830
Don't move!

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:37.760
President Kurasawa, why don't you explain...

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:40.550
I refuse.

00:13:54.320 --> 00:13:57.400
You called the Dobussie daughter, right?

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:02.000
Daughters are the children of humans and demons.

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:03.010
Children?

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:06.340
It doesn't grow inside the demon.

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:07.970
Well, duh.

00:14:08.300 --> 00:14:10.150
That thing wouldn't fit inside anybody.

00:14:11.310 --> 00:14:12.870
So what's the problem?

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:15.510
What is it doing on its own?

00:14:15.800 --> 00:14:17.470
This idiot abandoned it.

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:19.750
You're the contractor?

00:14:19.890 --> 00:14:22.000
It's all in the past.

00:14:22.430 --> 00:14:23.370
Why?

00:14:23.990 --> 00:14:27.070
Who wouldn't? Who wants that beast?

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:30.940
You knew it would be born when you entered the contract.

00:14:33.230 --> 00:14:35.510
He got cold feet.

00:14:35.870 --> 00:14:40.510
Just like every other man that leaves his pregnant girlfriend.

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:42.180
What a jerk.

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:45.250
Give us a hand, Kurosaki.

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:47.250
With what?

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:51.300
If that demon-hating Reishiro finds out about the daughter...

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:52.720
...he'll kill it immediately.

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:54.930
If the Science Club exists to protect demons...

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:58.370
...then naturally it would protect daughters as well.

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:01.490
What do you want us to do?

00:15:01.810 --> 00:15:04.200
Capture it before Reishiro finds it.

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:07.830
We can worry about Mahiwa later.

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:08.620
Well?

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:12.100
Do you have a problem protecting it?

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:14.020
Probably not.

00:15:14.020 --> 00:15:17.030
It's really none of your business.

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:20.900
There's no point. I can't do it.

00:15:21.010 --> 00:15:22.900
Then we'll eliminate it.

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:23.840
Senpai.

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:25.400
Please do.

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:26.990
Mahiwa.

00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:29.490
I've got nothing to do with it any more.

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:36.370
A daughter is the manifestation of the demon's feelings for the contractor.

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:40.790
It's running wild because its feelings for you have nowhere to go.

00:15:41.010 --> 00:15:42.860
If you can't accept it...

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:43.980
...that's sad.

00:15:45.720 --> 00:15:46.920
Just give up.

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:48.620
That's not important here.

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:49.630
Senpai.

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:52.240
Did you forget our deal with Reishiro?

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:56.590
We have a responsibility to the First Student Council.

00:15:56.920 --> 00:15:58.260
I won't let you interfere.

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:01.920
Looks like it wants to be killed.

00:16:19.270 --> 00:16:20.360
I've got you this time.

00:16:23.470 --> 00:16:24.270
Takatsuki!

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:25.900
Senpai!

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:29.340
There's no point if the contractor doesn't care.

00:16:30.570 --> 00:16:34.560
For now, we need to make sure the First Student Council doesn't find Dobussie.

00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:36.910
I'll protect it will Kurogane.

00:16:39.090 --> 00:16:40.750
He's got some spirit in him.

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:54.050
Himezasa.

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:21.000
Asura Machina.

00:17:25.530 --> 00:17:26.440
What is it doing?

00:17:26.800 --> 00:17:27.450
Miss President!

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:29.770
Lend me a hand. We'll capture it alive.

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:33.470
That's not what it looks like.

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:35.680
Stop running.

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:41.910
Kurosaki!

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:44.150
Yes?

00:17:52.780 --> 00:17:53.470
Tomo.

00:17:55.060 --> 00:17:57.410
You must not use the Asura Machina any more.

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:04.800
Come, Kurogane!

00:18:15.020 --> 00:18:16.110
Stop!

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:16.910
You'll kill it.

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:18.790
We have to subdue it first.

00:18:19.010 --> 00:18:20.460
Stay where you are.

00:18:23.390 --> 00:18:23.900
Senpai!

00:18:35.060 --> 00:18:36.540
What do you want?

00:18:37.230 --> 00:18:39.300
What are you doing to that precious daughter?

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:42.880
Weren't you just beating it to a pulp?

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:45.130
I intended to capture it alive.

00:18:45.380 --> 00:18:47.850
The cost of feeding it alone will grant me the demon's powers.

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:49.550
It's economical.

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:51.760
So you're after the money.

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:57.480
It is after all the teaching members of the Second Student Council Pilgrim Union adhere to.

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:07.010
The accumulation of wealth is God's wish.

00:19:07.300 --> 00:19:08.820
It's all about making money.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:10.920
The daughter is waiting.

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:14.360
It's lonely.

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:17.770
Its contractor is everything.

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:24.730
The Pilgrim Union's teachings...

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:27.520
...have no hold over me!

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:52.510
You...

00:19:52.990 --> 00:19:55.200
Take it, Tomoharu Natsume.

00:19:57.440 --> 00:19:59.540
This is it. Hold it tight.

00:19:59.870 --> 00:20:02.010
Don't let go.

00:20:03.850 --> 00:20:04.800
Senpai!

00:20:18.270 --> 00:20:19.030
Stop!

00:20:20.850 --> 00:20:23.060
Leave my daughter alone!

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:50.700
It's like a dog.

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:53.810
It finally reached its adult stage after being accepted by its contractor.

00:20:54.760 --> 00:20:58.200
What were you going to do if Dobussie hadn't saved him?

00:20:58.780 --> 00:21:00.630
It did save him. What does it matter now?

00:21:01.130 --> 00:21:03.810
And Dobi Lake's monster has been taken care of.

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:06.640
It's safe from Reishiro.

00:21:09.360 --> 00:21:12.510
Daughters instinctively protect their contractors.

00:21:14.280 --> 00:21:16.890
Does that mean Shuri planned all that?

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:21.640
I'm holding you responsible for any damage that was done to my Suisho.

00:21:21.820 --> 00:21:26.020
Then you pay to rebuild the lodge the daughter destroyed.

00:21:29.610 --> 00:21:31.850
We'll have to think of a name for you.

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:40.260
If you become her contractor...

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:44.430
...we'll have to destroy one of you.

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:48.850
What is he afraid of?

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:25.110
"Preview"

00:23:20.870 --> 00:23:22.030
Who am I?

00:23:22.030 --> 00:23:22.750
Rage?

00:23:22.970 --> 00:23:24.090
I am myself.

00:23:24.420 --> 00:23:25.140
Sorrow?

00:23:25.360 --> 00:23:26.880
Whatever happens to me...

00:23:27.050 --> 00:23:28.570
I died that day.

00:23:28.830 --> 00:23:30.390
White and black.

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:35.030
"Intersecting Hearts and Bodies"
